#: ../../source/docs/common-camera-gimbal.rst:5
#: cbf514cb9caa438d82642d8ccc6bb9a8
msgid "Servo Gimbal"
msgstr "舵机云台"

#: ../../source/docs/common-camera-gimbal.rst:10
#: 34b72036739544a0947ddbd21dbf2706
msgid ""
"ArduPilot can stabilize a servo gimbal with up to three axis of motion using"
" any of the free PWM output channels. Once connected the camera gimbal can "
"be controlled by the pilot using an RC transmitter, by sending commands from"
" the ground stations or autonomously during missions"
msgstr ""
"ArduPilot 可利用任意空闲 PWM 输出通道，稳定控制最多三轴运动的舵机云台。连接后，飞手可通过遥控器、地面站命令或自主任务来控制相机云台。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-camera-gimbal.rst:14
#: 26416ec7efd3445fbc8e7dc023746e25
msgid "Supported Gimbals"
msgstr "支持的云台"

