#: ../../source/docs/common-camera-gimbal.rst:22
#: b1f7032fd207415da344ec29459c4a77
msgid "Mounting the Camera and Gimbal"
msgstr "安装相机和云台"

#: ../../source/docs/common-camera-gimbal.rst:24
#: 0c642d72089b415aa5fcf81c40557048
msgid ""
"The camera needs to be mounted securely to the gimbal, but in such a way "
"that reduces/dampens vibrations from the motor."
msgstr "相机需牢固安装在云台上，同时应采用减震/隔振方式以降低电机震动传递。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-camera-gimbal.rst:27
#: d8b7fe4484f64734bf622788267407cf
msgid ""
"Common methods for mounting the camera on the gimbal include using soft "
"foam, stiff foam, neoprene tubes (mount camera on tube side), surgical tube,"
" rubber bands, nylon bolts (direct stiff attachment) and velcro."
msgstr "将相机安装到云台的常见方式包括：软泡沫、硬泡沫、氯丁橡胶管（将相机安装于管侧）、手术管、橡皮筋、尼龙螺栓（直接硬连接）以及魔术贴。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-camera-gimbal.rst:32
#: de6370a4895349939b4e9f0d5d48ad39
msgid "Connecting to the Autopilot"
msgstr "连接飞控"

#: ../../source/docs/common-camera-gimbal.rst:34
#: 591998b09145459ab25446b29972b918
msgid ""
"Connect the gimbal's roll, pitch, and/or yaw servos signal and ground pins "
"to the autopilot's PWM output pins as shown below.  Most autopilots do not "
"provide power on the servo rail meaning a separate BEC is required."
msgstr ""
"将云台横滚、俯仰和/或偏航舵机的信号线和地线连接到飞控的 PWM 输出引脚（如下图所示）。大多数飞控不在舵机轨道上提供电源，因此需要独立的 BEC。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-camera-gimbal.rst:40
#: 9ccce9dccabb41cf8179cbfd87927b9c
msgid "Configuration"
msgstr "配置"

#: ../../source/docs/common-camera-gimbal.rst:44
#: c8067fac7634412c9db4cdb95fc27662
msgid ""
"Mission Planner includes a \"Camera Gimbal\" configuration screen but it has"
" not yet been updated to work with ArduPilot 4.3 (and higher)."
msgstr "Mission Planner 包含「Camera Gimbal」配置界面，但尚未更新以支持 ArduPilot 4.3（及更高版本）。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-camera-gimbal.rst:46
#: c1bd33c122444c7d86301b12f65305fd
msgid ""
"Connect to the autopilot with a ground station and set the following "
"parameters. These settings assume the autopilot's PWM outputs 9, 10 and 11 "
"will control the gimbal's roll, pitch and yaw angles respectively. They also"
" assume common angular ranges of the gimbal which may need adjusting to "
"match the actual gimbal being used."
msgstr ""
"使用地面站连接飞控并设置以下参数。这些设置假定飞控的 PWM 输出 9、10 和 11 "
"分别控制云台的横滚、俯仰和偏航角。同时假定云台具有常见的角度范围，实际使用时可能需要根据云台调整。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-camera-gimbal.rst:48
#: 9ba73be4f7e5408cb5c18f6f795f37ad
msgid ""
"Currently up to two mounts can be supported, MNT1 and MNT2. The following "
"parameters are for the first mount. The second mount has the same "
"parameters."
msgstr "目前最多可支持两个云台，即 MNT1 和 MNT2。以下参数适用于第一个云台，第二个云台具有相同的参数。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-camera-gimbal.rst:50
#: 7c1f9497088d4a6b858388e1fdb11bb0
msgid ":ref:`MNT1_TYPE <MNT1_TYPE>` to 1 (Servo) and reboot the autopilot"
msgstr ":ref:`MNT1_TYPE <MNT1_TYPE>` 设为 1（Servo），然后重启飞控"

#: ../../source/docs/common-camera-gimbal.rst:51
#: 6ce3f9340c9b4c6e9b69bb2c98799f89
msgid ""
":ref:`MNT1_PITCH_MIN <MNT1_PITCH_MIN>` to -90 (meaning the gimbal can pitch "
"straight downwards)"
msgstr ":ref:`MNT1_PITCH_MIN <MNT1_PITCH_MIN>` 设为 -90（表示云台可俯仰至正下方）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-camera-gimbal.rst:52
#: 2cd9aecbefd44ceb97f99ea37459b060
msgid ""
":ref:`MNT1_PITCH_MAX <MNT1_PITCH_MAX>` to 25 (meaning the gimbal can pitch "
"up by 25 deg)"
msgstr ":ref:`MNT1_PITCH_MAX <MNT1_PITCH_MAX>` 设为 25（表示云台可向上俯仰 25 度）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-camera-gimbal.rst:53
#: 43785ab0c7f94720a2ac3d325ead038f
msgid ""
":ref:`MNT1_ROLL_MIN <MNT1_ROLL_MIN>` to -30 (meaning the gimbal can roll "
"right 30 deg)"
msgstr ":ref:`MNT1_ROLL_MIN <MNT1_ROLL_MIN>` 设为 -30（表示云台可向右横滚 30 度）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-camera-gimbal.rst:54
#: 4d94e6a8d47e402dbbece0080929e961
msgid ""
":ref:`MNT1_ROLL_MAX <MNT1_ROLL_MAX>` to 30 (meaning the gimbal can roll left"
" 30 deg)"
msgstr ":ref:`MNT1_ROLL_MAX <MNT1_ROLL_MAX>` 设为 30（表示云台可向左横滚 30 度）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-camera-gimbal.rst:55
#: a92f6c5e52eb4fb0ab8420bdeab14034
msgid ""
":ref:`MNT1_YAW_MIN <MNT1_YAW_MIN>` to -180 (meaning the gimbal can yaw to "
"the left 180deg)"
msgstr ":ref:`MNT1_YAW_MIN <MNT1_YAW_MIN>` 设为 -180（表示云台可向左偏航 180 度）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-camera-gimbal.rst:56
#: 797e814e7afe497ebfd99e35b1aaf1d5
msgid ""
":ref:`MNT1_YAW_MAX <MNT1_YAW_MAX>` to 180 (meaning the gimbal can yaw to the"
" right 180deg)"
msgstr ":ref:`MNT1_YAW_MAX <MNT1_YAW_MAX>` 设为 180（表示云台可向右偏航 180 度）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-camera-gimbal.rst:57
#: 449a8912ac0d413cb028d1bce7a2da28
msgid ""
":ref:`MNT1_RC_RATE <MNT1_RC_RATE>` to 90 (deg/s) to control speed of gimbal "
"when using RC targetting"
msgstr ":ref:`MNT1_RC_RATE <MNT1_RC_RATE>` 设为 90（度/秒），用于在使用 RC 瞄准时控制云台速度"

#: ../../source/docs/common-camera-gimbal.rst:59
#: 23bd9989b4d14bb796a7ae93179a978b
msgid ""
"Typical input and output assignments are shown below, but any unused RC "
"input channel or autopilot output channels can be assigned for some or all "
"of these functions."
msgstr "以下为典型的输入和输出分配，但任意未使用的 RC 输入通道或飞控输出通道均可分配给这些功能中的部分或全部。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-camera-gimbal.rst:61
#: 6c88f6b6732a4997b159cd38f6e965c6
msgid ":ref:`SERVO9_FUNCTION <SERVO9_FUNCTION>` to 8 (Mount1 Roll)"
msgstr ":ref:`SERVO9_FUNCTION <SERVO9_FUNCTION>` 设为 8（Mount1 Roll）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-camera-gimbal.rst:62
#: ec68a4350c1e411c88cd447adebee7b1
msgid ""
":ref:`SERVO9_MIN <SERVO9_MIN>` and :ref:`SERVO9_MAX <SERVO9_MAX>` to match "
"the min and max range of the roll servo"
msgstr ""
":ref:`SERVO9_MIN <SERVO9_MIN>` 和 :ref:`SERVO9_MAX <SERVO9_MAX>` "
"设为与横滚舵机的最小和最大范围匹配"

#: ../../source/docs/common-camera-gimbal.rst:63
#: dadce160b4d84ea982e4804f406838cc
msgid ":ref:`SERVO10_FUNCTION <SERVO10_FUNCTION>` to 7 (Mount1 Pitch)"
msgstr ":ref:`SERVO10_FUNCTION <SERVO10_FUNCTION>` 设为 7（Mount1 Pitch）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-camera-gimbal.rst:64
#: deb3057c34c741c39b0c7d30fcf1233f
msgid ""
":ref:`SERVO10_MIN <SERVO10_MIN>` and :ref:`SERVO10_MAX <SERVO10_MAX>` to "
"match the min and max range of the pitch servo"
msgstr ""
":ref:`SERVO10_MIN <SERVO10_MIN>` 和 :ref:`SERVO10_MAX <SERVO10_MAX>` "
"设为与俯仰舵机的最小和最大范围匹配"

#: ../../source/docs/common-camera-gimbal.rst:65
#: c36533896371462786c8580a1437bfee
msgid ":ref:`SERVO11_FUNCTION <SERVO11_FUNCTION>` to 6 (Mount1 Yaw)"
msgstr ":ref:`SERVO11_FUNCTION <SERVO11_FUNCTION>` 设为 6（Mount1 Yaw）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-camera-gimbal.rst:66
#: d7dee1f259e549698f3fd46736c97ebc
msgid ""
":ref:`SERVO11_MIN <SERVO11_MIN>` and :ref:`SERVO11_MAX <SERVO11_MAX>` to "
"match the min and max range of the yaw servo"
msgstr ""
":ref:`SERVO11_MIN <SERVO11_MIN>` 和 :ref:`SERVO11_MAX <SERVO11_MAX>` "
"设为与偏航舵机的最小和最大范围匹配"

#: ../../source/docs/common-camera-gimbal.rst:67
#: 3eaad6cf3b21492da1aa3b8d94356c6c
msgid ""
":ref:`RC6_OPTION <RC6_OPTION>` = 213 (\"Mount Pitch\") to control the "
"gimbal's pitch rate with RC channel 6"
msgstr ""
":ref:`RC6_OPTION <RC6_OPTION>` = 213（「Mount Pitch」），通过 RC 通道 6 控制云台俯仰速率"

#: ../../source/docs/common-camera-gimbal.rst:68
#: 4b1ed977b4ba47ba94231f2a482179e6
msgid ""
":ref:`RC7_OPTION <RC7_OPTION>` = 214 (\"Mount Yaw\") to control the gimbal's"
" yaw rate with RC channel 7"
msgstr ":ref:`RC7_OPTION <RC7_OPTION>` = 214（「Mount Yaw」），通过 RC 通道 7 控制云台偏航速率"

#: ../../source/docs/common-camera-gimbal.rst:69
#: cce5283b1d9b41e1b18370021ff8198d
msgid ""
":ref:`RC8_OPTION <RC8_OPTION>` = 163 (\"Mount Lock\") to switch between "
"\"lock\" and \"follow\" mode with RC channel 8"
msgstr ""
":ref:`RC8_OPTION <RC8_OPTION>` = 163（「Mount Lock」），通过 RC 通道 8 "
"在「锁定」和「跟随」模式之间切换"

