msgstr "其他参数"

#: ../../source/docs/common-camera-gimbal.rst:90
#: 1395442253e74657bc87a1bcb99874f1
msgid ""
"Since servos in the gimbal may react slower to position/angle changes in the"
" vehicle's roll and pitch as the vehicle moves about a target, the camera "
"shot may have some visible lag in it. This can be reduced by using these "
"parameters to have the gimbal outputs move a bit ahead of the movements of "
"the vehicle."
msgstr ""
"由于云台中的舵机在飞行器围绕目标运动时，对飞行器横滚和俯仰位置/角度变化的响应可能较慢，拍摄画面可能出现可见的延迟。可通过以下参数让云台输出略微超前于飞行器运动来减小延迟。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-camera-gimbal.rst:93
#: 13073ef168ce471aa6bea8235f6323c3
msgid ":ref:`MNT1_LEAD_RLL<MNT1_LEAD_RLL>`"
msgstr ":ref:`MNT1_LEAD_RLL<MNT1_LEAD_RLL>`"

#: ../../source/docs/common-camera-gimbal.rst:94
#: b0f3344c9635464eb4d0ecc0d90e1548
msgid ":ref:`MNT1_LEAD_PTCH<MNT1_LEAD_PTCH>`"
msgstr ":ref:`MNT1_LEAD_PTCH<MNT1_LEAD_PTCH>`"
